<title>POLAND: All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at today's primary auction on total demand of 1.073 billion zlotys against a one billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p>   T-bill	    8-week  13-week  26-week  39-week 52-week</p>
<p>   new min price    --	94.86    90.03	--     81.80</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)    --     (94.88)  (90.07)     --    (81.84)</p>
<p>   new max price    --	94.98    90.12	--     81.91</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)    --     (95.00)  (90.18)     --    (82.03)</p>
<p>   offer		--	200.0    300.0	--     500.0</p>
<p>   bids recorded    --	296.8     88.5	--     687.5</p>
<p>   bids accepted    --	202.1     57.8	--     568.2</p>
<p>   next auction    200.0    200.0    200.0	--     500.0</p>
<p>NOTE. Offer and all bids in million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
